# Copy to apps/gate/.env (gitignored) and fill in. Leave empty to run on local demo data only.
# Expo builds EXPO_PUBLIC_ variables into the app itself, so only values that are safe to ship belong here.
# For EAS builds, set the same name with `eas env:create`; .env is not uploaded.

# The Supabase project URL. The app only ever calls DigiGate's Edge Functions, with its own device token.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=

# Never put a Supabase secret key here.
